WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.248 --> 00:00:13.349
ran out of Gem's Jewelry.

2
00:00:13.369 --> 00:00:16.210
"My wallet's gone!"

3
00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:17.170
a man yelled.

4
00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:19.531
"My phone's gone!"

5
00:00:19.871 --> 00:00:20.712
a woman shouted.

6
00:00:22.472 --> 00:00:23.913
A man looked down at his bare feet.

7
00:00:23.933 --> 00:00:26.174
"Who took my shoes?"

8
00:00:27.574 --> 00:00:29.435
Roxy saw something dart into an alley.

9
00:00:30.095 --> 00:00:31.116
She flew to the alley.

10
00:00:31.964 --> 00:00:33.566
A woman stood near an open door.

11
00:00:34.606 --> 00:00:36.268
The woman wore a tight bodysuit.

12
00:00:36.988 --> 00:00:39.050
Electricity sparked along its surface.

13
00:00:40.111 --> 00:00:42.973
Roxy saw money and other items poking out from a big sack.

14
00:00:44.094 --> 00:00:44.915
The woman chuckled.

15
00:00:44.935 --> 00:00:48.258
"This is so easy!"

16
00:00:48.278 --> 00:00:50.099
Then she vanished.

17
00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:52.021
Roxy looked around.

18
00:00:52.041 --> 00:00:53.602
"Where did she go?"

19
00:00:54.723 --> 00:00:55.764
The woman appeared again.

20
00:00:56.485 --> 00:00:57.806
Now the sack looked empty.

21
00:00:58.847 --> 00:00:59.407
She laughed.

22
00:01:01.012 --> 00:01:03.153
"It's time to steal some more!"

23
00:01:03.173 --> 00:01:06.054
"You're under arrest!"

24
00:01:06.434 --> 00:01:07.075
Roxy called.

25
00:01:07.875 --> 00:01:08.855
The woman smiled.

26
00:01:08.875 --> 00:01:11.416
"Hello, Rocket Girl."

27
00:01:11.436 --> 00:01:15.638
Fwoosh! She vanished and then appeared behind Roxy.

28
00:01:15.658 --> 00:01:18.319
"Do you think you can catch me?"

29
00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:20.980
Roxy spun to face the woman.

30
00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:23.841
Fwoosh! The woman disappeared again.

31
00:01:24.782 --> 00:01:26.402
Now she was on the other side of Roxy.

32
00:01:27.443 --> 00:01:29.864
"I'm too fast for you, Rocket Girl!"

33
00:01:30.868 --> 00:01:32.149
Roxy ran toward the woman.

34
00:01:33.049 --> 00:01:35.891
Fwoosh! The woman was at the other end of the alley now.

35
00:01:36.891 --> 00:01:37.572
She laughed.

36
00:01:38.572 --> 00:01:41.154
"Nobody can catch me.

37
00:01:41.774 --> 00:01:43.995
My suit gives me super speed!"

38
00:01:45.076 --> 00:01:46.376
"Who are you?"

39
00:01:46.737 --> 00:01:47.477
Roxy asked.

40
00:01:48.438 --> 00:01:49.398
The woman grinned.

41
00:01:49.418 --> 00:01:53.320
"I'm the fastest thief in the world—that's who I am.

42
00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.881
But you can call me Flick.

43
00:01:56.482 --> 00:01:57.482
Flick Flash."

44
00:01:58.183 --> 00:02:00.324
Fwoosh! Flick dashed off.

45
00:02:01.128 --> 00:02:02.189
Roxy shot after her.

46
00:02:02.209 --> 00:02:04.831
"Wow," she thought.

47
00:02:04.851 --> 00:02:07.914
"Flick is even faster than I am!"

48
00:02:08.934 --> 00:02:10.516
Flick blasted by a newsstand.

49
00:02:11.156 --> 00:02:12.497
The wind knocked the stand over.

50
00:02:13.258 --> 00:02:14.619
A man was working inside.

51
00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:16.961
Magazines and candy fell on him.

52
00:02:17.261 --> 00:02:20.784
"Ugh!" Roxy chased Flick into the street.

53
00:02:22.125 --> 00:02:24.767
Flick zigzagged among cars, buses, and bikes.

54
00:02:26.248 --> 00:02:28.010
A man on a bike lost his balance.

55
00:02:32.504 --> 00:02:33.185
"Whoa!" He fell off.

56
00:02:33.685 --> 00:02:34.966
The bike rolled into traffic.

57
00:02:35.006 --> 00:02:39.330
"Ahh!" A delivery truck driver slammed his brakes.

58
00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:41.271
The truck skidded into the bike.

59
00:02:41.812 --> 00:02:44.173
Crunch! Then—bam!

60
00:02:44.894 --> 00:02:46.395
A taxi crashed into the truck.

61
00:02:47.796 --> 00:02:48.737
Roxy hurried over.

62
00:02:48.757 --> 00:02:50.559
"Is everyone okay?"

63
00:02:51.239 --> 00:02:52.440
The two drivers nodded.

64
00:02:53.761 --> 00:02:55.382
The man from the bike gave a thumbs-up.

65
00:02:56.723 --> 00:02:57.684
Roxy looked around.

66
00:02:58.705 --> 00:03:00.046
Flick was running toward a building.

67
00:03:00.927 --> 00:03:02.068
Roxy took off after her.

68
00:03:03.272 --> 00:03:05.833
She gasped as Flick ran up the side of the building.

69
00:03:07.634 --> 00:03:10.495
"I didn't know she could do that!"

70
00:03:11.376 --> 00:03:12.576
Roxy flew up after her.

71
00:03:13.517 --> 00:03:16.658
She was right behind Flick.

72
00:03:16.698 --> 00:03:17.998
Roxy reached out to grab her.

73
00:03:18.779 --> 00:03:21.360
Just then Flick zoomed past a window washer.

74
00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:24.701
Fwoosh! The worker's seat swung wildly.

75
00:03:25.302 --> 00:03:26.422
His rope snapped.

76
00:03:27.543 --> 00:03:28.063
He fell.

77
00:03:28.083 --> 00:03:30.024
"Rocket Girl!
